## Goal
Perform a principal component analysis (PCA) of the gene count matrix to visualize sample relationships and identify dominant sources of variation. The analysis will reveal whether samples cluster by experimental condition (untreated vs. treated) and expose any hidden structure in the data that may indicate batch effects or other patterns.

